        "description": {
          "text": "Added Zepzelca in combination with atezolizumab (or atezolizumab and hyaluronidase-tqjs) for maintenance treatment of adult extensive-stage SCLC not progressed after first-line induction therapy",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval sNDA provides for the use of Zepzelca (lurbinectedin) intravenous infusion, in combination with atezolizumab or atezolizumab and hyaluronidase-tqjs, for the maintenance treatment of adult patients with extensive-stage small cell lung cancer in whose disease has not progressed after first-line induction therapy with atezolizumab or atezolizumab and hyaluronidase-tqjs, carboplatin, and etoposide.",
